<title>UK: Argentina sets 20 billion peseta 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets 20 billion peseta 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BSN.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN PTA    COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    23.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    23.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  62 BP     LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  B1/BB     DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
